# RESETIUS | Sierpinsk { ; William McWorter
# RESETIUS |   ; Isoceles right triangle dissects into two congruent
# RESETIUS |   ; isoceles right triangles
# RESETIUS |   Angle 8
# RESETIUS |   Axiom L
# RESETIUS |   L=+R-F-R+
# RESETIUS |   R=-L+F+L-
# RESETIUS |   }
